{"unit_id":"tag:08L5:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed spaces）的一阶增厚（first order thickening）。假设给定扩张（extensions）<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>，如（<REF_0001>）中所示，以及映射（maps）<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>若存在一个<MATH_0004>模映射（module map）<MATH_0005>，与<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>相容（compatible），则图（diagram）<MATH_0008>是交换（commutative）的。\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0009>模（module）的映射（maps）<MATH_0010>，与<MATH_0011>和<MATH_0012>相容（compatible），它们的集合（set）若非空（nonempty），则是<MATH_0013>下的一个主齐性空间（principal homogeneous space）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"module map","target_term":"模映射"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"给定增厚的空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给增厚。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"两个模扩张。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"给定与所求的映射。"},{"source_term":"module map","target_term":"模映射","context":"结构层线性的映射。"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容","context":"与端项映射相容。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"所展示的方形。"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"方形的性质。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"中间项模。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"相容映射的集合。"},{"source_term":"nonempty","t