{"unit_id":"tag:08L5:proof","translation":"第（1）部分直接来自映射（maps）的描述。对于（2），若<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是两个映射（maps）<MATH_0003>，与<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>相容（compatible），则<MATH_0006>分解（factors）为<MATH_0007>。中间的映射（map）来自<MATH_0008>的一个唯一元素（element），这是由《模（Modules）》，引理<REF_0001>得出的。反之，给定一个元素（element）<MATH_0009>，属于此群（group），我们可以将该复合（composition）（如上所示，中间为<MATH_0010>）加到<MATH_0011>上。一些细节略。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"中间项映射。"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容","context":"与给定端项映射相容。"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"分解","context":"差映射的分解。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"分解中间的映射。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Hom 群元素。"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"所指的 Hom 群。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"所展示的映射复合。"}],"notes":["remark：原文省略一些细节，未补写。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08L6:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed spaces）的一阶增厚（first order thickening）。假设给定扩张（extensions）<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>，如（<REF_0001>）中所示，以及映射（maps）<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>。假设图（diagram）<MATH_0004>是交换（commutative）的。那么存在一个元素（element）<MATH_0005>，其消失（vanishing）是存在映射（map）<MATH_0006>且与<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>相容（compatible）的充要条件（necessary and sufficient condition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"增厚涉及的空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给增厚。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"两个模扩张。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"给定的端项映射。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"所展示的方形。"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"该图的条件。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Ext 群中的障碍类。"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失","context":"障碍为零。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"所求中间项映射。"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容","context":"与端项的映射相容。"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件","context":"存在映射的判据。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08L7:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed spaces）的一阶增厚（first order thickening）。假设给定<MATH_0002>模（modules）<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>，以及一个<MATH_0005>线性（linear）映射（map）<MATH_0006>。若存在列（sequence）（<REF_0001>），满足<MATH_0007>，则这些扩张（extensions）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）在<MATH_0008>下是主齐性（principal homogeneous）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"所给增厚的空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"平方零增厚。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"两个给定模。"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性","context":"结构层线性。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"所给 c 映射。"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列","context":"所引用的扩张列。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"满足指定条件的模扩张。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"模扩张的同构类。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"这些同构类组成的集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性","context":"Ext 群的作用。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08L9:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed space）。一个一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0002>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡（trivial）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，若存在带环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）<MATH_0003>，它是<MATH_0004>的左逆（left inverse）。这样的态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>的选择称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>平凡化（trivialization）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，属于该一阶增厚（first order thickening）。给定<MATH_0006>，可得到分裂（splitting）<MATH_0007>，作为<MATH_0008>上的代数（algebras）层（sheaves），方法是使用<MATH_0009>分裂（split）满射（surjection）<MATH_0010>。反之，这样的分裂（splitting）决定一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>。<MATH_0012>的平凡化的一阶增厚（trivialized first order thickenings）的范畴（category）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0013>模（modules）的范畴（category）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"left inverse","target_term":"左逆"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"trivialization","target_term":"平凡化"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"trivialized first order thickenings","target_term":"平凡化的一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"带环空间","context":"所给空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所讨论的增厚。"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡","context":"此处定义的性质。"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射","context":"所求带环空间态射。"},{"source_term":"left inverse","target_term":"左逆","context":"复合为恒等的左侧逆态射。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所选的态射。"},{"source_term":"trivialization","target_term":"平凡化","context":"此处定义的选择。"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂","context":"代数层的直和分解。"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数","context":"作为代数的结构层。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"代数层。"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂","context":"满射的截面。"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"结构层的满射。"},{"source_term":"trivialized first order thickenings","target_term":"平凡化的一阶增厚","context":"带平凡化选择的增厚。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"上述对象的范畴。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两个范畴的等价。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模。"}],"notes":[]}
